  "page": 52,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.056396484375,
        354.8602600097656,
        88.63139343261719
      ],
      "text": "3.2.2\t Summary of evidence and rationale",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 15.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.20639038085938,
        486.2975158691406,
        115.62739562988281
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 27: Package of interventions for people with advanced HIV disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.38239288330078,
        527.4212646484375,
        129.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "Tuberculosis is a marker for advanced HIV disease and is well recognized as a leading cause of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.3824005126953,
        527.3793334960938,
        143.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "morbidity and mortality among people living with HIV. People with HIV and TB have a higher risk",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.3824005126953,
        527.4529418945312,
        157.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "of mortality compared with people with TB who do not have HIV. Other causes of mortality among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.3824005126953,
        527.3936767578125,
        171.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "adults with advanced HIV disease globally include severe bacterial infections, cryptococcal disease,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.3824005126953,
        527.4161987304688,
        185.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "histoplasmosis, toxoplasmosis and  pneumonia. Addressing these other  Pneumocystis jirovecii",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        185.3824005126953,
        527.43994140625,
        199.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "comorbidities as part of an integrated package of care for people with HIV-associated TB can help",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3824005126953,
        527.4200439453125,
        213.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "to reduce mortality. TB and HIV programmes are therefore encouraged to work together to expand",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        213.3824005126953,
        484.8511657714844,
        227.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "access to an integrated package of care for advanced HIV disease among people with TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.3824005126953,
        527.428955078125,
        255.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation is based on two RCTs: REMSTART   and REALITY  . REMSTART was  (103) (104)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.3824005126953,
        527.41796875,
        269.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "conducted in the United Republic of Tanzania and Zambia, and randomized 1999 ART-naïve adults",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.38238525390625,
        524.4285888671875,
        283.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "with HIV with CD4 count < 200 cells/mm  to either standard care or standard care plus enhanced clinic- 3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.38238525390625,
        527.4200439453125,
        297.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "based care with serum cryptococcal antigen (CrAg) screening, pre-emptive antifungal treatment for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.38238525390625,
        527.4386596679688,
        311.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "those who screened positive for CrAg, as well as additional community support (comprising a weekly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.38238525390625,
        527.384765625,
        325.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "home or community visit by trained and paid lay workers who delivered ART, provided adherence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.3824157714844,
        527.3927001953125,
        339.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "support and monitored participants for signs and symptoms of drug toxicity or new symptoms). The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.3824157714844,
        527.390380859375,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "intervention group had 28% fewer people dying: mortality was 13% in the intervention group versus",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.3824157714844,
        290.4031982421875,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "18% in the group receiving standard care  .  (103)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.3824157714844,
        527.4155883789062,
        395.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "The REALITY study enrolled 1805 people living with HIV with CD4 counts < 100 cells/mm in Kenya,  3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.3824157714844,
        527.4221801757812,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Malawi, Uganda and Zimbabwe  . Participants were mainly adults (72 were 5–17 years old).  (104)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.3824157714844,
        527.4188842773438,
        423.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "All underwent screening for TB disease at enrolment and were then randomized to the standard",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.3824157714844,
        527.4156494140625,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "of care (co-trimoxazole) according to national guidelines or an enhanced prophylaxis package: 12",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.3824157714844,
        527.4298706054688,
        451.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "weeks of fluconazole (100 mg once daily), 12 weeks of a fixed-dose combination of co-trimoxazole",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.3824157714844,
        527.4187622070312,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "(800 + 160 mg) + isoniazid (300 mg) + pyridoxine (25 mg) as a scored once-daily tablet, five days",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.3824157714844,
        527.4155883789062,
        479.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "of 500 mg of azithromycin once daily and a single dose of 400 mg of albendazole. All drugs were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.3824157714844,
        527.3826904296875,
        493.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "started simultaneously, and ART was offered on the same day as the prophylaxis package. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.3824157714844,
        527.4225463867188,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "enhanced prophylaxis package at the time of ART initiation reduced mortality by 27% (from 12.2%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.3824462890625,
        527.43994140625,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "to 8.9%) over 24 weeks. Mortality from Cryptococcus species declined considerably, from 1.5% to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.3824462890625,
        527.434326171875,
        535.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "0.4%, and mortality from unascertained causes (most people died at home) declined from 6.0% to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.3824462890625,
        527.4135131835938,
        549.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "3.8%. TB incidence was reduced by 28%, cryptococcal disease by 62% and hospitalization by 17%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.3824462890625,
        527.4268798828125,
        563.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "in the enhanced prophylaxis group versus the standard-of-care group. Most of the deaths in this",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.42236328125,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "study occurred within the first three weeks, highlighting the value of early prophylaxis for people with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.3823852539062,
        179.34970092773438,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "advanced disease  . (104)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.2064208984375,
        427.9986877441406,
        619.6273803710938
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations 28–29: Timing of ART initiation for HIV-associated TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.3823852539062,
        527.3717651367188,
        633.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "Early initiation of ART for people living with HIV-associated TB is critical in reducing morbidity and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.3823852539062,
        527.3948974609375,
        647.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "mortality and preventing HIV transmission. HIV and TB programmes should ensure that people with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.3823852539062,
        527.3904418945312,
        661.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "TB who also have HIV are offered ART as early as possible, preferably within integrated services or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.3823852539062,
        527.3934326171875,
        675.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "within TB facilities  . In 2010, WHO recommended that ART be started as soon as possible within  (10)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        675.3823852539062,
        527.4100952148438,
        689.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "eight weeks of initiating TB treatment, and in 2012, WHO recommended to initiate ART within two",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.3823852539062,
        527.4091186523438,
        703.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "weeks among those with CD4 count ≤ 50 cells/mm . Since 2021, WHO has recommended that ART  3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        703.3823852539062,
        527.4036254882812,
        717.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "should be started as soon as possible within two weeks of initiating TB treatment, regardless of CD4",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        717.3823852539062,
        487.5975036621094,
        731.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "cell count for people with drug-susceptible TB and in whom TB meningitis is excluded  .  (21)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.8661003112793,
        801.2599487304688,
        51.10609817504883,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "34",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        801.2599487304688,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.4364013671875,
        801.2599487304688,
        170.0603790283203,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        170.06539916992188,
        801.2599487304688,
        364.234375,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis. Module 6: tuberculosis and comorbidities",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}